On 27 June 2016 at 13:40, <herrmann-m at uni-landau.de> wrote:

> Hi!
>
> I was performing pairwise DAPCs on a data set containing > 62.000 SNPs in
> 4 populations.
>
> Because of a problem with my PLINK input, my SNPs were initially in a
